---
title:    "A Typeful Integration of SQL into Curry"
citation: "(WFLP 2016)"
url:      "http://dx.doi.org/10.4204/EPTCS.234.8"
date:     2016-01-01 # used for sorting, most recent first, should usually match the papers date
---
This paper describes the integration of SQL queries
in Curry programs in a type-safe manner,
based on a logical description of the relational database
as an entity-relationship (ER) model.